---
import catalog from '../../labs/catalog.json';
import { Code } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
interface Props { lessonId: string }
const lesson = catalog.lessons.find((row) => row.lessonId === Astro.props.lessonId);
if (!lesson?.implemented) throw new Error(`工作区任务未发行：${Astro.props.lessonId}`);
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const download = `${base}downloads/inventory/${catalog.release}/`;
const start = lesson.startCheckpoint;
const end = lesson.endCheckpoint;
---
<aside class="lesson-task" aria-label="本课工作区任务" data-lesson-task={lesson.lessonId}>
  <p><strong>{lesson.labId} · 本课只完成这一项</strong></p>
  <p>接续 {lesson.previousLesson === 'C00' ? '初始骨架' : lesson.previousLesson + ' 的自己的代码'}，工作目录：<code>labs/inventory/</code>。</p>
  <p>改动文件：{lesson.files.map((file, i) => <>{i > 0 && '、'}<code>{file}</code></>)}</p>
  <p>跨课沿用正在运行的服务。首次运行或切换界面时启动 dev；切换前用 Ctrl+C 停止旧服务，改完源码再运行 check。</p>
  <Code code={`${lesson.commands.start}\n${lesson.commands.dev}\n${lesson.commands.check}`} lang="sh" title="在库存工作区执行" />
  <ul>{lesson.acceptance.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
  <p><a href={`${download}${start}.tar.gz`}>下载本课起点（仅补课/恢复）</a> · <a href={`${base}labs/`}>一次安装与恢复说明</a></p>
  <details><summary>完整参考解（答案）</summary><p>先保存自己的修改。<a href={`${download}${end}.tar.gz`}>下载本课终点参考解</a>；可运行 <code>{`npm run lab -- compare ${lesson.lessonId}`}</code> 只读比较，不会替换文件。</p></details>
</aside>
<style>
  .lesson-task { border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-text-accent); border-radius: .7rem; padding: 1.2rem; margin-block: 1.5rem; background: var(--sl-color-accent-low); }
  p { margin-block: .6rem; } code { overflow-wrap: anywhere; } ul { padding-inline-start: 1.5rem; }
</style>
